    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 11
      },
      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A woman in her fifties with silver hair escaping a once-elegant braid, gaunt and hollow-cheeked, wearing a stained velvet Academy coat with gold piping. Ink stains her fingers to the knuckle. Her eyes are bright, wet and fixed on something far away; her lips shape a tune.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.U8ZFHQbadEPnC1T2]{02. The Perfect Song}.</strong> Leader of the Academy composers and the Influence target (6 Influence within 6 rounds). NPC Core Maestro, with Perception +18 and Will +16 from the encounter.</p>"
    },
